that on Google Cloud.

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:52.930
So what we can do now is set
up programmatic notifications

00:01:52.930 --> 00:01:54.350
for cost control
on Google Cloud.

00:01:54.350 --> 00:01:55.600
MELANIE WARRICK: This is good.

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:56.710
