in the show notes.

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:08.223
Basically, to fire off a Cloud
function which could then

00:02:08.223 --> 00:02:10.150
do things like send a
notification to Slack,

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:11.740
possibly send you an email.

00:02:11.740 --> 00:02:13.944
You could even do stuff
like just turn off billing

00:02:13.944 --> 00:02:16.360
or possibly turn off certain
resources within your project

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:17.890
to help slow down
the amount of cost

00:02:17.890 --> 00:02:18.895
that you're having,
depending on what it is

00:02:18.895 --> 00:02:19.830
that you're building.

00:02:19.830 --> 00:02:20.800
