00:33:00.152 --> 00:33:01.110
MARK MANDEL: Thank you.

00:33:01.110 --> 00:33:03.990
But where do I go to
learn more about GDPR

00:33:03.990 --> 00:33:05.490
in regards to Google
Cloud Platform,

00:33:05.490 --> 00:33:08.140
and the effect it has, and all
the stuff that I need to know?

00:33:08.140 --> 00:33:09.170
I am not a lawyer.

00:33:09.170 --> 00:33:09.750
MELANIE WARRICK: You are not.

