00:33:10.400 --> 00:33:11.100
MARK MANDEL: Yeah.

00:33:11.100 --> 00:33:12.210
MELANIE WARRICK: And
this is regulation

00:33:12.210 --> 00:33:15.360
in the EU law on data protection
and privacy for all individuals

00:33:15.360 --> 00:33:16.710
within the European Union.

00:33:16.710 --> 00:33:19.170
It addresses the export
of personal data outside

00:33:19.170 --> 00:33:20.230
